  "historyNote": "#5261, eff 10-30-91, EXPIRED 10-30-97 New. #6666, eff 1-1-98; ss by #8450, eff 10-21-05; ss by #9966, eff 7-29-11; ss by #10647, eff 7-24-14; ss by #13461, eff 10-13-22",
